    "description": "<p>You may perform Rituals whose effects fall within the <strong>Chimerism</strong> discipline.</p><p>When you acquire this Skill, choose <strong>【INS + WLP】</strong> <strong>or</strong> <strong>【MIG + WLP】</strong>. From now on, your <strong>Chimerism</strong> Rituals will use the chosen Attributes for the Magic Check.</p><hr><p>For <strong>Rituals</strong> breakdown, refer to: @UUID[Compendium.projectfu.handouts.JournalEntry.IAF8g9kqFz87zfDr]{Ritual Rules} or see <strong>Core Rulebook,</strong> page <strong>118</strong>.</p>",
